{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Operator authorization clarification\n\nThe writing rules remain approved as author-facing guidance. The rejected mechanism is mechanical enforcement that produces false positives. The F01 plan now restores the Writing rules and Protected forms sections, requires an explicit non-validator statement, and excludes new hooks, tests, CI gates, or runtime rejection based on the guidance. All criteria are reset for fresh verification.\n\nGerrit change 2040 patch set 1 became stale under this clarification. CI run 32540968793 was cancelled before any replacement patch was pushed. The test jobs marked as cancelled are not test-failure evidence.\n\nCI_RESULT {\"run_id\":\"32540968793\",\"status\":\"cancelled\",\"duration\":436,\"fixes_applied\":[\"Cancelled stale patch set after operator scope clarification\"],\"retry_count\":0}"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787359642616711001,"uuid":"3b5573fa-c13f-425d-8901-49a5e10b018a"}